<p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Background%20names%202da" title="Background names 2da">background_names 2da</a> defines the starting area, starting waypoint, and surname for each race and class combination. It also provides a default creature template for the character, a default male forename, and a default female forename. These can be overridden by the player during character creation.
</p><p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> is defined as an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> and has an <b>ID</b> of <b>1001</b>. It can be extended by m2da fragments which have names starting with <b>background_names</b>. It can be referenced in scripting using the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_STARTING_EQUIPMENT</a> constant defined in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2da%20constants%20h" title="2da constants h">2da_constants_h</a>.
</p>
