<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The ID for each row is calculated using this formula (defined in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Chargen%20GetEquipIndex" title="Chargen GetEquipIndex (page does not exist)">Chargen_GetEquipIndex</a> function):
</p>
<div dir="ltr" class="mw-geshi mw-code mw-content-ltr"><div class="dascript source-dascript"><pre class="de1">nRace <span class="sy0">*</span> <span class="nu0">1000</span> <span class="sy0">+</span> nClass <span class="sy0">*</span> <span class="nu0">100</span> <span class="sy0">+</span> nBackground</pre></div></div>
<p>Where <code>nRace</code>, <code>nClass</code> and <code>nBackground</code> are the value of the corresponding ID from the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/RACE%20base%202da" title="RACE base 2da">race</a>, <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/CLA%202da" title="CLA 2da">class</a> and <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Backgrounds%202da" title="Backgrounds 2da">background</a> 2da files.
</p>
